Z||000001||SCCA FIERO||09-08-2000||11:57 PM||||It will fit an 87, but not 85 and 86. I assume you are talking about V6's... if not then no, the 88 4 cylinder pan will not fit any other year. In 88 they put the oil filter in the oilpan. I think there were some 87's that had the same type of pan/filter combo, but don't quote me on that.||||reg||1
